KeyHelp
The app talks to the documented KeyHelp REST API of a server you administer.
It contains no code, text or images from KeyHelp. The test fixtures in
src/mock/ are invented data shaped like the API's documented responses. The
screenshots in docs/screenshots/ show the app with that invented data.

